  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92881e52a5557ad48bff7e44722f0285, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 2 Stage 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SubtitleData
  entries:
  - startTime: 0
    duration: 25
    indonesianText: Setiap benda memiliki massa yang unik dan membedakannya dari
      benda lain. Massa tersebut dapat diketahui melalui faktor-faktor seperti volume
      dan densitasnya, gaya yang bekerja padanya beserta percepatan yang dihasilkan,
      serta berat yang dipengaruhi oleh gravitasi. Oleh karena itu, perbedaan massa
      antar benda secara alami menimbulkan perbedaan besar kecilnya gaya yang dihasilkan
    englishText: Every existing object possesses a unique mass that distinguishes
      it from others. These masses can be identified through factors such as their
      respective volumes and densities, the forces acting on them, and their resulting
      accelerations, as well as their weights influenced by gravitational acceleration.
      Consequently, variations in mass among objects inherently give rise to differences
      in the magnitude of the forces they produce
